  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Disability Capacity Building Programme - global support through IDA (Apr &apos;23 onwards)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for capacity building delivered by the International Disability Alliance. This includes Bridge CRPD-SDG training for organisations of persons with disabilities, the Global Disability Summit secretariat, and the secretariat for the Global Action on Disability (GLAD) network of donors. This is for work from April 2023 onwards; previous work by IDA carried out jointly with Sightsavers is under project -103.</narrative>
  </description>
